   "format": "kv",
   "template": "# Super Mario Sunshine settings generated by Android Launcher\n",
   "notes": "Plain 'key = value' lines (space, equals, space), no sections, '#' comments, written whole by the launcher (Settings.save: header line, then every key; via a .tmp file). Keys are case-sensitive; SMS_* keys are upper case. Equivalent to an INI with no section. The folder is the data folder: default getExternalFilesDir, or the path in /data/data/io.github.them3dium.mareshine/shared_prefs/sunshine.xml key data_dir. Settings.ensureDefaults writes the defaults on first start."
  }
 },
